  "title": "Profile and optimize agentic AI on Windows",
  "description": "Learn how to profile and optimize agentic AI apps on Intel-powered Windows PCs. In this live demo, analyze performance across CPU, GPU, and NPU to identify bottlenecks and improve responsiveness and power efficiency. See how to build performance profiles and apply tuning techniques using Intel Tracing Technology, OpenVINO, and Windows ML.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
